{"id":"41a1b9b0-690d-45ad-a148-c1e419e9be47","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244598,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"Write/update notes for pages 7-20 covering taxonomy, reasoning categories, and acting/multi-agent material seen so far.\",\"code\":\"r1=write_note(title='overview',content='论文把 agentic LLM 定义为接收自然语言输入、推理决策并自主行动以达成目标的 agent（p4）。三类能力 reasoning-acting-interacting 相互支撑；交互结果可用于数据增强形成良性循环（p4-5）。文献选择：最初用 Google Scholar 检索 “Agentic LLM”，随后用 snowballing 方法从引用中发现未收录工作；只选基于 LLM 的方法（p5 §1.2）。§1.3 介绍 LLM 训练流水线（预训练、SFT、指令微调、对齐、推理；p5-6），§1.4 指出 prompt engineering、hallucination 等对 agentic LLM 的需求（p6）。',evidence_ids=['ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f','ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881','ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'],section='overview')\\nr2=write_note(title='reasoning',content='§2 讲推理：(1) 多步推理，如 Chain of Thought（Wei 2022）逐步提示，零样本加 “Let’s think step by step” 也提升（p7-9）。(2) 自反思 self reflection（p10-13）。(3) 检索增强 retrieval augmentation。Table 1（p9）区分各类推理技术。思维树等搜索方法属于自动提示改进/搜索类。',evidence_ids=['ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'],section='reasoning')\\nprint(r1,r2)\"}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8094,"completion_tokens":391,"total_tokens":8485,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3614},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}